parish"],["ARC or PLC in Madison Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/madison-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 45% of normal in November to December. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids sat at 34% of normal in February to March, then 162% in May to June. Grid 14854 had its driest year in 2010 at 57%.</p>"}
